        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AMERSFOORT -->
    <div class="loc-card fade-section" data-num="II">
      <span class="loc-badge">Afternoon &mdash; Celebration</span>
      <h3 class="loc-name">Amersfoort</h3>
      <p class="loc-region">Eemland &middot; Utrecht Province</p>
      <p class="loc-desc">
        One of the best-preserved medieval cities in the Netherlands, Amersfoort enchants with its canals, historic spires, and convivial café terraces. The afternoon reception and dinner unfold in the heart of the old town — a warm and lively setting to raise a glass and celebrate the new chapter.
      </p>
      <div class="loc-meta">
        <div class="loc-row">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7z"/>
